OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fto the evening, with plenty of
OL,7,Fpleasant evening sunshine. Cloud will
OL,8,Fstart to thicken across higher ground
OL,9,Fto the north overnight. Thundery
OL,10,Fshowers moving in from the south
OL,11,Fthrough the early hours. Feeling mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy start to Wednesday
OL,14,Fwith heavy or thundery showers. Cloud
OL,15,Flifts into the afternoon, bringing
OL,16,Fsome brighter or sunny spells,
OL,17,Falthough scattered heavy or thundery
OL,18,Fshowers still possible. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
